title: Game Over.
new-page: true
go-to: eg_menu
audio: music/TchaikovskyQuartet2.ogg
on-arrival: {!
// Achievements:
this.achieve('game_completed');

if (Q.dreamteam == 1) {
    this.achieve('golden_age_of_the_peoples_commissars');
}
!}



= End

@eg_menu

- #endings
- @end_game: End game.

@dreamteam
title: Golden Age of the People's Commissars
view-if: dreamteam = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

We assembled an all-star composition in the Council of People's Commissars. 

@vikzhel_averted
title: Vikzhel Negotiator
view-if: vikzhel_averted
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

We averted the Vikzhel Strike by negotiating an all-socialist coalition government.

@lsr_coalition
title: Children of October
view-if: lsr_coalition
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

We formed a coalition government between the Bolsheviks and Left-SRs. 



@achievements
title: Achievements
tags: endings
new-page: true
go-to: eg_menu if started == 1; root.start_menu_2 if started == 0

= Completed Achievements in this Playthrough

<div id="achievement-playthrough"></div>

= Completed Achievements Overall

<div id="achievement-overall"></div>

= Incomplete Achievements

<div id="achievement-incomplete"></div>

@end_game
game-over: true
